OL,5,G1300 Classical Live
OL,6,     FMark Forrest introduces an
OL,7,     Fafternoon of great music,
OL,8,     Fincluding performances from the
OL,9,     FMunich Philharmonic Orchestra and
OL,10,     Fchamber music from across Bavaria.
OL,11,G1600 Composer of the Week: The Mighty
OL,12,G     Handful
OL,13,     F4/5. Donald Macleod looks at a
OL,14,     Frich period of stage works for the
OL,15,     Fgroup. Now freed from Balakirev's
OL,16,     Fcriticism, Mussorgsky worked on
OL,17,     Fhis opera Boris Godunov.
